  "instance_name": "meme_format_of_juxtaposition",
  "label": "Meme format using juxtaposition for irony or satire",
  "description": "The meme format relies on the juxtaposition of a sentimental, universally accepted phrase with an image that is culturally associated with absurdity or irony. This requires background knowledge of internet meme culture, where juxtaposition is a common technique to create humor or critique. The meme's effectiveness depends on the viewer understanding that the image and text are intentionally mismatched to create a comedic or critical effect, often at the expense of the sentiment being referenced. This is a common trope in online humor.",
